          p_en='Vouchsafe also unto the temporal magistrates, the Roman Emperor, all Christian kings, princes and lords, but especially unto our most gracious lord and prince of the land, his Electoral Grace’s consort, the young lordship and damsels, and also the whole most laudable house of Saxony, long life, abiding health, together with all temporal and eternal welfare; and likewise unto all their counsellors and officers grace and unity to rule the subjects according to thy divine will and good pleasure, that righteousness may be furthered, and wickedness hindered and punished, that we may accomplish our life in quiet rest and good peace, as becometh Christians.',
